6290..6366 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6367..6441 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6442..6518 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6519..6593 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6594..6602 Comment "/// `g`."
